      "ActivityPersuitPurposesDescription": "Ivory s Rock Foundation (IRF) is a charitable institution for the advancement ofeducation and registered in Australia as a Company Limited by Guarantee. It wasestablished in 2010 to support a distinctive message of personal peace and fulfilment, available to everyone, regardless of race, religion, or culture, through the Peace Education Program. The Peace Education Program is delivered in over 70 countries in over 30 languages and is based on the talks of international author and peace advocate, Prem Rawat. In 2025 IRF supported the Peace Education Program inAustralia, which is currently being undertaken by corrections facilities, educational facilities in Australia, NZ and the Pacific and health and well-being centres.",
